  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project provides technical assistance to member countries to strengthen human rights protection and provision. The project will build capacity and consensus around pertinent human rights issues with a view to strengthening national human rights frameworks. This will involve enabling national human rights obligations and member countries? effective participation with international human rights mechanisms and assisting with the implementation of subsequent outcomes.???</narrative>
